            {
              "id": "mžd.I.d.part-pass.2",
              "sense": null,
              "turoyo": "aṯi u=zʕuro u=garwono zbəṭle u=məšḥo w-kfəxle b-feme d-Kayalo w-hiye damixo l=ule w-lo=šqile našəf b-dukṯe (…) nafiqo i=žənəke ko-ḥayro Kayalo kale mžido qayiso našifo",
              "translation": "The bald boy came, grabbed the (boiling) butter and poured it in Kayalo’s mouth, while he was sleeping. He did not move, he stiffened where he sat (…). The woman came out and saw that Kayalo was stretched and completely frozen",
